  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-02-01",
   "text": "Arctic Refuge Protection Act \nThis bill repeals the Arctic National Wildlife Refuge oil and gas program. \n The bill designates approximately 1,559,538 acres of land within Alaska in the Arctic National Wildlife Refuge as a component of the National Wilderness Preservation System."
  }
